00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:13.864
Really, really sturdy.

00:07:13.864 --> 00:07:15.172
I'm gonna take a look
at this one more time,

00:07:15.172 --> 00:07:16.547
side by side.

00:07:16.547 --> 00:07:18.570
Laif: Now, I will tell
you about one other thing

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:19.860
that Cartier does.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.470
They have a secret signature on the dial.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.530
AC: On the dial?

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:24.871
Laif: Yes, so I'm gonna ask you

00:07:24.871 --> 00:07:26.971
to find the secret signature.

00:07:26.971 --> 00:07:28.087
It'll say Cartier.

00:07:28.087 --> 00:07:28.920
AC: OK.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.419
Laif: And it's hidden. It's not obviously,

00:07:30.419 --> 00:07:31.522
right, the big Cartier

00:07:31.522 --> 00:07:33.130
