00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.563
But there's another
hidden Cartier signature.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:38.383
AC: Oh, I found it.

00:07:38.383 --> 00:07:39.783
It's, like, I guess in between

00:07:39.783 --> 00:07:42.660
the six and the next number over here.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:43.886
Is that it?
Laif: Yes.

00:07:43.886 --> 00:07:45.159
AC: All right. So, what I noticed also,

00:07:45.159 --> 00:07:46.600
