00:08:28.816 --> 00:08:31.100
But now, the watch that
I'm gonna hand you,

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:33.112
retailing for about $30,000

00:08:33.112 --> 00:08:34.690
'cause they are so collectible.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:36.280
What are the first things
that you're noticing?

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.018
AC: I'm noticing some similarities,

00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:39.830
just inside, under the dome,

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.332
but also noticing some differences,

00:08:41.332 --> 00:08:44.490
so I think I need to take a closer look.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:45.660
Laif: Absolutely.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:46.930
Definitely dive into these.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.247
AC: I'll start with this one.

00:08:52.285 --> 00:08:53.890
The logo looks right.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:54.931
Laif: It's called the coronet.

00:08:54.931 --> 00:08:56.964
AC: The coronet, yes. [laughs]

00:08:56.964 --> 00:08:59.540
Laif: Given this era of watch,

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:01.256
we expect that the tritium

00:09:01.256 --> 00:09:02.450
